    "body": "From the edits to OP there it seems I thought it was decided on 21 February 2025 at the latest as only then the minor issue is marked as resolved. Unfortunately I'm unable to find more context.\n\nMaybe @rniwa remembers more?\n\nIf everyone wants it to perform upgrades we should probably just change it and worry about adding options later. (We can't cross the shadow boundary though, but it seems that's okay.)\n\nI'll also move this issue to whatwg/html as this API is defined there.",
