    "updated_at": "2025-11-13T23:40:37Z",
    "body": "After the discussion at TPAC, we agreed that we will update the spec so that\n\n- `CustomElementRegistry.initialize` will run upgrade on **not shadow inclusive descendant** given that the descendant has the same registry as the caller `this`\n\n\nThank you @annevk for taking this change and let me know if I captured anything incorrectly above.\n\ncc @rniwa @sorvell @justinfagnani @leotlee",
